# Profile-specific Docker Compose environment template.
# Copy each enabled profile's block into ignored deploy/profile/<profile>.env.
# Frontend JWT public keys and analysis-feedback endpoints must remain isolated
# per profile. Entra credentials are frontend-only and never belong here.

